 "body": "Refactors the order pipeline to an event-sourced model (design doc: https://acme.atlassian.net/wiki/ORD-ES). Orders are now derived from `order_events`; `orders.status` is dropped in favor of a projection.\n\nGenerated protobuf types included. Unit tests added for every handler.",
